CheckStock item;pos
⍝ Checks the current stock level and displays inventory information for products.
pos ← ItemName⍳⊂item
:If pos>(⍴ItemName)
⎕ ← 'Item not Found'
:Else
⎕ ← 'Item name: ' , ItemName[pos]
⎕ ← 'Current Stock is ' , Quantity[pos]
    :If Quantity[pos] ≥ 30
    ⎕ ← ' Quantity is above the minimum'
    :Else
    ⎕ ← ' Quantity is lower than minimum'
    ⎕ ← 'We need at least' (30 - Quantity[pos]) , ' of units to fill up the minimum'
    :EndIf
:EndIf
